OL,3,GNEWSAStaff at Grand Theft Auto VI      
OL,4,Adeveloper vote against union           
OL,5,Arecognition                            
OL,7,FStaff at the developer behind the Grand
OL,8,FTheft Auto game franchise have voted   
OL,9,Fagainst recognising a workplace union. 
OL,11,FMore than 1,500 workers at Rockstar,   
OL,12,Fwhich has an office in Edinburgh, took 
OL,13,Fpart in the two-week ballot over formal
OL,14,Frecognition by the Independent Workers'
OL,15,FUnion of Great Britain (IWGB).         
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
