OL,3,GNEWSAStaff at Grand Theft Auto VI      
OL,4,Adeveloper vote against union           
OL,5,Arecognition                            
OL,7,FThe vote took place during an          
OL,8,Femployment tribunal concerning a group 
OL,9,Fof Rockstar staff who claim they were  
OL,10,Fdismissed for trade union activities   
OL,11,Flast year. Rockstar has denied this and
OL,12,Falleged staff were sacked for          
OL,13,Fdiscussing confidential information    
OL,14,Fonline.                                
OL,16,FAbout 75% of staff balloted voted      
OL,17,Fagainst union recognition proposals,   
OL,18,Fwith 24.7% backing them.               
